class on Saturday. Please call me back before Monday to let me know."}],"script":"Hi, this is Jack from the language school. I am calling about your English course. Unfortunately, the evening class on Tuesday has been cancelled because the teacher is ill. We can move you to the Thursday class at the same time, seven o'clock, or you can join the morning class on Saturday. Please call me back before Monday to let me know."},{"id":"cert_english_b1_eb1r","kind":"reading","text":"Many cities are trying to reduce traffic by encouraging people to cycle. In one town, the council built thirty kilometres of separate bike lanes and offered cheap bicycle repairs. After two years, the number of people cycling to work had doubled, although some drivers complained that roads had become more crowded. The council says that the town is now cleaner and quieter."}],"questions":[{"id":"cert_english_b1_q01","section":"grammar","passage_id":null,"stem":"If it ___ tomorrow, we will stay at home.","choices":[{"id":"a","text":"is raining"},{"id":"b","text":"rains"},{"id":"c","text":"rained"},{"id":"d","text":"will rain"}],"answer":"b","hash":"56cad6b4"},{"id":"cert_english_b1_q02","section":"grammar","passage_id":null,"stem":"She has lived here ___ 2019.","choices":[{"id":"a","text":"since"},{"id":"b","text":"for"},{"id":"c","text":"during"},{"id":"d","text":"from"}],"answer":"a","hash":"1bbc96c0"},{"id":"cert_english_b1_q03","section":"grammar","passage_id":null,"stem":"I am not used to ___ up so early.","choices":[{"id":"a","text":"get"},{"id":"b","text":"got"},{"id":"c","text":"having got"},{"id":"d","text":"getting"}],"answer":"d","hash":"b02123e0"},{"id":"cert_english_b1_q04","section":"grammar","passage_id":null,"stem":"The window ___ by a boy last night.","choices":[{"id":"a","text":"was broken"},{"id":"b","text":"broke"},{"id":"c","text":"has broken"},{"id":"d","text":"is breaking"}],"answer":"a","hash":"cd5a04f6"},{"id":"cert_english_b1_q05","section":"grammar","passage_id":null,"st